swirl: amber: every LED within 30+2 degrees of the colour: yes (0 outside)
swirl: amber: the band reaches both edges (27 degrees or more each way): yes
swirl: amber: a brightness wave (trough at most 65% of the crest): yes; no LED dark: yes
swirl: amber: it moves every frame: yes; ZMK's frame unchanged: yes
